  "title": "Video &#038; Gallery: Dot-to-Dot 2015",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\"><em>5th June 2015</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-large wp-image-8033\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0849-675x450.jpg\" alt=\"Pretty Vicious @ Thekla\" width=\"675\" height=\"450\" /><br />We had so much fun at this year&#8217;s Dot-to-Dot Festival that we felt it would be poor form to not share what we saw and heard with you too.</p>\n<p>So click below to see our interview with Rhodes, Bristol music legend Big Jeff, and clips of PINS, Best Coast, Pretty Vicious and so much more.</p>\n<p>Enjoy!<br />&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;<br />We start like all good tales at the beginning with our interview with Rhodes:</p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"The Fix Interview - Rhodes at Dot-to-Dot 2015 by The Fix Magazine\" width=\"640\" height=\"400\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?visual=true&#038;url=https%3A%2F%2Fapi.soundcloud.com%2Ftracks%2F207449069&#038;show_artwork=true&#038;maxheight=960&#038;maxwidth=640\"></iframe></p>\n<p>&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;<br />Just a taster gallery:<br /><a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0866.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-thumbnail wp-image-8036\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0866-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"Best Coast @ Trinity\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0866-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0866-45x45.jpg 45w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0861.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-thumbnail wp-image-8035\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0861-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"H Hawkline @ The Exchange\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0861-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0861-45x45.jpg 45w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0852.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-thumbnail wp-image-8034\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0852-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"The Amasons @ The Exchange\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0852-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0852-45x45.jpg 45w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0849-e1433459881281.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-thumbnail wp-image-8033\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0849-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"Pretty Vicious @ Thekla\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/fave-2-e1433460690417.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-thumbnail wp-image-8031\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/fave-2-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"PINS @ Trinity\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" /></a> <a href=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0815.jpg\" target=\"_blank\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-thumbnail wp-image-8030\" src=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0815-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"Rhodes @ O2 Academy\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" srcset=\"https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0815-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.thefixmagazine.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/05/DSC_0815-45x45.jpg 45w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 150px) 100vw, 150px\" /></a><br />&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8212;&#8211;<br />To give you a full appreciation of the day we spoke with the people who make it so special&#8230;you:</p>\n<p><iframe loading=\"lazy\" title=\"The Fix @ Dot to Dot 2015, Bristol UK\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/O1DF1G6bJ7A?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></p>\n<p><strong>Kevin Mcgough</strong><br /><strong>Photos Alex Robbins</strong></p>\n<p></p>",
